DATA UPLOAD TO PUBLIC CLOUDS:

The following KQL query is used to check for DNS requests to popular public cloud apps and public cloud storage apps:

DeviceNetworkEvents
| where InitiatingProcessAccountName == "INITIATINGPROCESSACCOUNTNAME"
| where RemoteUrl has_any ("drive.google.com", "www.box.com", "www.icloud.com", "onedrive.live.com", "www.sync.com", "drive.proton.me", "www.zoho.com/workdrive", "www.jottacloud.com", "koofr.eu")
| project TimeGenerated, DeviceName, ActionType
| order by TimeGenerated desc
